# Cut & Keep (Cursor rules)

Follow `.agents/SKILL.md` and `.agents/AGENTS.md`.

## Git commits

- **Title:** English only — `type(scope): summary`
- **Body:** Korean
- **Footer:** Korean

Never put Korean in the commit title.

After documenting a commit, create:

`docs/branchs/commits/YY_MM_DD_[sha]_[name]_[branch].md`

## Branches

- Work/commits on `feature/*` only.
- Linear integrate merges **only into `develop` or `main`**.
- Finish feature → merge to `develop` (not feature→feature as main path).
- See `docs/guidance/branch-merge.md`.

## Code layout

- `backend/app/routers|schemas|repositories|models|db|services|workflows`
- `frontend/` user app · `console/` ops console

## Docs

Prefer updating the matching folder under `docs/` (guidance, repeater, branchs, …).
